  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7ef42231652fcda41b73cf85791d6841, type: 3}
  speakerName: Shana
  DialogText:
  - Welcome to the the tutorial asshole
  - 'Let''s go over the basics. In the top left of your screen is the Turn Count
    which displays how many turns have passed. '
  - 'To the right of that is your Thread of Fate ( Turn Order) which shows you whose
    turn it currently is, represented by the middle icon under the red arrow, to
    the right of that middle the next two turns, and to the left of it the last two
    turns. Hover over the Thread of Fate to see more turns ahead.  '
  - 'In the bottom left is your Action Commands, Attack, Skill, Item and Flee. '
  - 'Why don''t you try pressing the attack button. Use the mouse to select it.  '
  textSpeed: 0
  endNodeEvent:
  - BattleOn
  startNodeEvent:
  - BattleOff
